      "description": "AIM ETF Products Trust - AllianzIM International Equity Buffer15 Uncapped Oct ETF is an exchange traded fund launched and managed by Allianz Investment Management LLC. It invests in public equity markets. The fund invests through derivatives in stocks of companies operating across diversified sectors. The fund uses derivatives such as FLexible EXchange Options that reference the performance of the iShares MSCI EAFE ETF to create its portfolio. The fund invests in growth and value stocks of diversified companies. AIM ETF Products Trust - AllianzIM International Equity Buffer15 Uncapped Oct ETF was formed on September 30, 2026 and is domiciled in the United States.",
